              <zone h='34313' id='20' name='Churn Rate by Payment Method' w='39916' x='41751' y='64687'>
                <layout-cache fixed-size-h='241' minwidth='260' type-h='fixed' type-w='scalable' />
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98000' id='25' type-v2='text' w='17666' x='81667' y='1000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Key Insights</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>26.54%</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> of customers churned, indicating a significant customer retention challenge. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• Customers on </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Month-to-month contracts</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> showed the highest churn (</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>42.71%</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>), while </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Two-year contracts</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> had the lowest (</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>2.83%</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>). </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Fiber Optic</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> users recorded the highest churn (</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>41.89%</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>), suggesting possible service or pricing concerns. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• Customers paying via </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Electronic Check</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> churned the most (</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>45.29%</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>), making them a high-risk customer segment. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>•Customers with </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>longer tenure</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> were significantly more likely to stay, highlighting the importance of early customer retention.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='dashed' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
